msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"You've done it again, Kiryu-san! I must say, I'm impressed.\r\n"
"Raising a hostess to the highest rank there is... That's no\r\n"
"small task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"But I suppose that's what I saw in you when you first\r\n"
"approached me. That unmistakable leadership ability."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Well, I'm just glad %s turned out to be so good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Yes indeed! From here on out, I'm going to work hard with\r\n"
"%s-chan to make the club even better than before!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "About that, Sasaki-san... I actually have an announcement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Oh? You do? Then please go ahead, I'd be happy to⑬\r\n"
"Wait a minute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Yeah, so... I'm quitting. Effective immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Whaaaaaaaaaat!? %s-chan, not you too! But why...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Well... now that I'm number one here, I thought I'd be good\r\n"
"enough to work in Tokyo and make some real money. Sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Beh..."

msgctxt "240"
msgid "*sigh* I suppose there's not much I can do about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "...Don't worry. I'll help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Natsume-chan...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I know what you must be thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"But I swear, I'm not up to anything this time. I know I've\r\n"
"been a terrible hostess... And... I was wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"I realized that after watching you work so hard to help\r\n"
"those girls reach the top. Meanwhile, I was off running\r\n"
"around, behaving like a spoiled little girl..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Every girl Kiryu-san coached turned out to be excellent\r\n"
"hostesses. The way they went above and beyond to put the\r\n"
"customers first was what stood out to me the most."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"You showed me that's how a real pro operates. So from now\r\n"
"on, I'm gonna put my heart and soul into my work, like I\r\n"
"used to... That is, as long as that's okay with you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"...Of course, it is, Natsume-chan. Together, we can put\r\n"
"this club back on the map! Are you ready!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "Assolutamente."

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"That's amazing, Kiryu-san! Raising a hostess to the highest\r\n"
"rank there is... That's no small task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"But I suppose that's what I saw in you when you first\r\n"
"approached me. That unmistakable leadership ability."
msgstr ""

