msgid "Yeah, so... I'm quitting. Effective immediately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Wh... Wh... Whaaaaaaaaaat!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"I wanna challenge myself. So I'm gonna leave Okinawa and\r\n"
"travel the world... to gain more life experience!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I think that I should work as a hostess in a lot of places,\r\n"
"actually. I want to grow more as a person, using the\r\n"
"knowledge and skills I learned here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "*sigh* Well, with an answer like that... how can I object?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "...I suppose it's back to square one for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

