msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"I like this club, and I love working with you and the rest\r\n"
"of the staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"But, since I started as a hostess, I've met a lot of people\r\n"
"and found my true calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"The job's been fun... But now, I want to meet even more\r\n"
"people. From all walks of life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"And... now that I'm number one here, I thought I'd be good\r\n"
"enough to work in Tokyo⑬the most happening place in Japan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"*sigh* Well, with an answer like that... how can I object?\r\n"
"All right, then. If that's your dream, then go for it."
msgstr ""

